; Period commentary for 2025. See ../2023/commentary.journal for the format.

2025-03-31 Q1 2025  ; commentary:
    ; No revenue. Expenses were high from the UptimeRobot ($348.00) and Migadu
    ; ($19.00) annual renewals. I also added a GoatCounter GitHub sponsorship
    ; in mid-February, raising the monthly GitHub charge from $5.30 to $15.90.
    ;
    ; Excluding the renewals, regular burn is about $79/mo, roughly 14 months
    ; of runway. No annual renewals are expected in Q2.

2025-06-30 Q2 2025  ; commentary:
    ; No revenue; routine operations with no annual renewals. Regular burn has
    ; stabilized at about $79/mo, roughly 11 months of runway.

2025-09-30 Q3 2025  ; commentary:
    ; No revenue; routine operations with no annual renewals. Roughly 7.6
    ; months of runway.

2025-12-31 Q4 2025  ; commentary:
    ; No revenue; routine operations with no annual renewals. Equity declined
    ; all year with no revenue, leaving roughly 4.4 months of runway, so a
    ; capital contribution is planned for early 2026.
